  ],
  "duration_s": 494.678889,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了，第十到第六，秦朝丢了五十万，宋朝丢了一百万，宋朝丢了八十万，汉朝丢了两百万，西晋丢了两百五十万。好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。有人说唐朝呢明朝呢，清朝呢别急，今天这集就是第五道第一，一个比一个狠。最后那个只统一了五十一年，就把整个北方丢光了，还让中国分裂了三百年。老规矩，开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听第五名，清朝嘉庆年间，清朝疆域达到一千三百一十六万平方公里，是仅次于元朝的最大版图，可从一八五八年开始，沙俄趁火打劫，逼着清政府签了混条约，割走了黑龙江以北六十万平平方公里。两年后，北京条约又割走了。乌苏里江以东四十万平方公里，包括库叶岛，一八六四年堪分西北界约记。巴尔喀什湖以东以南四十四万平方公里，没了。从一八五八年到一九四六年，沙俄和苏联一共隔走了中国一百七十万平方公里，加上策动外蒙古独立，一共三百三十万平方公里，脱离了中国的怀抱，占清朝全盛时期领土的四分之一。可清朝丢的不只是沙俄、英国、法国、德国、日本都来咬一口，签了三百多个不平等条约，丢了台湾，丢了香港，丢了澳门。可为什么清朝只排第五？因为清朝虽然丢的多，但他的底子大丢了，三百多万还剩九百多万，不像有些朝代丢了就真的没了。第四名，元朝元朝是中国历史上疆域最大的朝代，鼎盛时期，一千三百七十五万平方公里，可元朝也是丢的最快的。从忽必烈死后的几十年里，元朝内部皇位争夺不断，不到四十年，换了九个皇帝，国力迅速衰落。中亚和西域的诸韩国逐渐脱离了元朝的控制，西部大片领土名存实亡。元朝末年，农民起义遍地，朱元璋北伐元顺帝逃回草原。元朝在全国的统治结束，从统一到灭亡，不到一百年，丢掉了将近四百万平方公里。您说这是大还是虚？我前阵子翻到一本叫中华文化常识一千问的书。这本书把中国历史上的文化常识分门别类，讲的清清楚楚。从三皇五帝到明清，从政治经济到科技文化，一千个问题一千个答案，咱们这几集讲的这些朝代丢了多少地，签了什么条约，为什么丢的书里都有？他不是那种干巴巴的教科书，是一问一答的形式。翻到哪页，看哪页，特别适合中老年朋友，每天翻两页。一年下来，中国历史的基本脉络心里全有谱了。我已经放下面了，点开就能看到喜欢历史的朋友，弄一本放床头，随手翻一页就是一段历史。第三名，唐朝安史之乱以前，唐朝是一千二百三十七万平方公里，安史之乱以后，一切都变了。为了评判，唐肃宗把河西弄右西域的精兵全部东掉，吐蕃趁虚而入，河西走廊丢了，龙又丢了。安溪四镇丢了吐蕃，统治敦煌整整七十年河西，五郡凉州甘州宿州瓜州沙洲一个一个陷落，史书上写此去安息万里江，如今边防在奉翔。什么意思？以前安西都护府在万里之外，现在边防退到了凤翔，离长安没多远了。唐朝中后期，西域、河西走廊、辽东大片领土相继丢失，总湿地面积超过六百万平方公里。一个万国来朝的大唐，最后连自己的都城都被吐蕃攻陷过。您说这是安史之乱还是盛极而衰？第二名，明朝永乐年间，大明版图达到最大。一千一百万平方公里，可到了崇祯皇帝自杀的时候，明朝实际控制的只剩汉地十八省四百多万平方公里，丢掉了将近七百万平方公里。怎么丢的？朱棣为了打靖难之役，把大明都司送给了蒙古人，宣宗时期开平行内迁，整个北平行都司放弃丢套到地区东胜位撤销门户大开关。西七位哈密丢了七位百姓迁进嘉峪关土地全被吐鲁番汗国占了，乌斯藏朵干，青藏高原也丢了云南布政司。下面的三圈六卫，缅甸占了泰国，占了明朝，号称不和亲，不纳贡，不成臣不割地，可实际上丢的地比谁都多。第一名，西晋等等，西晋不是第六名吗？对，第六名是西晋丢掉的北方领土。我说的第一名是西晋从统一到灭亡，丢掉的全部领土。西晋统一三国的时候，疆域五百四十多万平方公里，可西晋是历史上最短命的大一统王朝之一。从统一到灭亡，只用了五十一年，八王之乱打了十六年，把自己人打的精疲力尽。北方的匈奴，鲜卑节将五个少数民族，趁乱南下永嘉之乱。洛阳丢了，长安丢了，西晋灭亡，北方全部沦陷。东晋退到江南，只剩三百来万平方公里。西晋丢掉了北方将近两百五十万平方公里。可惜晋丢掉的不只是土地，是整个北方是中原，是长安，是洛阳，是汉人。几百年来经营的家底。从此以后，中国南北分裂了将近三百年，别的朝代丢了地，后来还收回来。一些西晋丢了地，直接导致了五胡乱华，导致了南北朝，导致了中国历史上最长的一段分裂时期。您说这个第一名服不服？您听出来了没有？这十个朝代没有一个是因为弱才排上来的秦朝毁在统一太短，隋朝败在操之过急，宋朝栽在重文轻武，汉朝坏在后期失控，戚晋死在自家人打自家人，清朝亏在签了三百多个不平等条约。元朝乱在皇位争夺，唐朝垮在安史之乱，明朝错在主动放弃。西晋，痛在直接导致三百年分裂。每一个朝代丢掉的领土都不只是一串数字，是一段教训，点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00001",
      "start_ms": 230,
      "end_ms": 730,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00002",
      "start_ms": 730,
      "end_ms": 1430,
      "text": "咱们盘了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1430,
      "end_ms": 2790,
      "text": "第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3330,
      "end_ms": 5130,
      "text": "秦朝丢了五十万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00005",
      "start_ms": 5630,
      "end_ms": 7350,
      "text": "宋朝丢了一百万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7890,
      "end_ms": 9790,
      "text": "宋朝丢了八十万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10090,
      "end_ms": 11770,
      "text": "汉朝丢了两百万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12210,
      "end_ms": 14530,
      "text": "西晋丢了两百五十万。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15150,
      "end_ms": 17390,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00010",
      "start_ms": 17510,
      "end_ms": 19910,
      "text": "有人说唐朝呢明朝呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00011",
      "start_ms": 20050,
      "end_ms": 21350,
      "text": "清朝呢别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00012",
      "start_ms": 21710,
      "end_ms": 23850,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00013",
      "start_ms": 24050,
      "end_ms": 24990,
      "text": "一个比一个狠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00014",
      "start_ms": 25330,
      "end_ms": 27930,
      "text": "最后那个只统一了五十一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00015",
      "start_ms": 28290,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "就把整个北方丢光了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00016",
      "start_ms": 30620,
      "end_ms": 32440,
      "text": "还让中国分裂了三百年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00017",
      "start_ms": 32960,
      "end_ms": 33640,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00018",
      "start_ms": 33740,
      "end_ms": 34600,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00019",
      "start_ms": 34760,
      "end_ms": 36640,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00020",
      "start_ms": 36940,
      "end_ms": 40220,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00021",
      "start_ms": 40480,
      "end_ms": 42260,
      "text": "清朝嘉庆年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00022",
      "start_ms": 42680,
      "end_ms": 46680,
      "text": "清朝疆域达到一千三百一十六万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00023",
      "start_ms": 47080,
      "end_ms": 50160,
      "text": "是仅次于元朝的最大版图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00024",
      "start_ms": 50740,
      "end_ms": 52560,
      "text": "可从一八五八年开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00025",
      "start_ms": 53100,
      "end_ms": 54400,
      "text": "沙俄趁火打劫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00026",
      "start_ms": 54860,
      "end_ms": 57400,
      "text": "逼着清政府签了混条约，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00027",
      "start_ms": 57860,
      "end_ms": 60615,
      "text": "割走了黑龙江以北六十万平平方公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00028",
      "start_ms": 61170,
      "end_ms": 61915,
      "text": "两年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00029",
      "start_ms": 62330,
      "end_ms": 64580,
      "text": "北京条约又割走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00030",
      "start_ms": 64740,
      "end_ms": 68225,
      "text": "乌苏里江以东四十万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00031",
      "start_ms": 68550,
      "end_ms": 69465,
      "text": "包括库叶岛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00032",
      "start_ms": 70050,
      "end_ms": 72545,
      "text": "一八六四年堪分西北界约记。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00033",
      "start_ms": 73120,
      "end_ms": 76400,
      "text": "巴尔喀什湖以东以南四十四万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00034",
      "start_ms": 76400,
      "end_ms": 76855,
      "text": "没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00035",
      "start_ms": 77400,
      "end_ms": 79535,
      "text": "从一八五八年到一九四六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00036",
      "start_ms": 80130,
      "end_ms": 84595,
      "text": "沙俄和苏联一共隔走了中国一百七十万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00037",
      "start_ms": 85210,
      "end_ms": 87195,
      "text": "加上策动外蒙古独立，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00038",
      "start_ms": 87710,
      "end_ms": 90045,
      "text": "一共三百三十万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00039",
      "start_ms": 90350,
      "end_ms": 91805,
      "text": "脱离了中国的怀抱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00040",
      "start_ms": 92460,
      "end_ms": 95565,
      "text": "占清朝全盛时期领土的四分之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00041",
      "start_ms": 96400,
      "end_ms": 103480,
      "text": "可清朝丢的不只是沙俄、英国、法国、德国、日本都来咬一口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00042",
      "start_ms": 103640,
      "end_ms": 105580,
      "text": "签了三百多个不平等条约，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00043",
      "start_ms": 105700,
      "end_ms": 106504,
      "text": "丢了台湾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00044",
      "start_ms": 106780,
      "end_ms": 107525,
      "text": "丢了香港，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00045",
      "start_ms": 107750,
      "end_ms": 108315,
      "text": "丢了澳门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00046",
      "start_ms": 108810,
      "end_ms": 110875,
      "text": "可为什么清朝只排第五？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00047",
      "start_ms": 111400,
      "end_ms": 113375,
      "text": "因为清朝虽然丢的多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00048",
      "start_ms": 113790,
      "end_ms": 115460,
      "text": "但他的底子大丢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00049",
      "start_ms": 115460,
      "end_ms": 117365,
      "text": "三百多万还剩九百多万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00050",
      "start_ms": 117910,
      "end_ms": 120950,
      "text": "不像有些朝代丢了就真的没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00051",
      "start_ms": 121030,
      "end_ms": 121755,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00052",
      "start_ms": 122030,
      "end_ms": 126495,
      "text": "元朝元朝是中国历史上疆域最大的朝代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00053",
      "start_ms": 127400,
      "end_ms": 128380,
      "text": "鼎盛时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00054",
      "start_ms": 128560,
      "end_ms": 131345,
      "text": "一千三百七十五万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00055",
      "start_ms": 131850,
      "end_ms": 133745,
      "text": "可元朝也是丢的最快的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00056",
      "start_ms": 134150,
      "end_ms": 136235,
      "text": "从忽必烈死后的几十年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00057",
      "start_ms": 136650,
      "end_ms": 139195,
      "text": "元朝内部皇位争夺不断，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00058",
      "start_ms": 139570,
      "end_ms": 140445,
      "text": "不到四十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00059",
      "start_ms": 140710,
      "end_ms": 141870,
      "text": "换了九个皇帝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00060",
      "start_ms": 141990,
      "end_ms": 143685,
      "text": "国力迅速衰落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00061",
      "start_ms": 144670,
      "end_ms": 148505,
      "text": "中亚和西域的诸韩国逐渐脱离了元朝的控制，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00062",
      "start_ms": 149370,
      "end_ms": 152095,
      "text": "西部大片领土名存实亡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00063",
      "start_ms": 153020,
      "end_ms": 153885,
      "text": "元朝末年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00064",
      "start_ms": 154150,
      "end_ms": 155305,
      "text": "农民起义遍地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00065",
      "start_ms": 156760,
      "end_ms": 159815,
      "text": "朱元璋北伐元顺帝逃回草原。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00066",
      "start_ms": 160230,
      "end_ms": 162250,
      "text": "元朝在全国的统治结束，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00067",
      "start_ms": 162650,
      "end_ms": 164265,
      "text": "从统一到灭亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00068",
      "start_ms": 164530,
      "end_ms": 165525,
      "text": "不到一百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00069",
      "start_ms": 165910,
      "end_ms": 168165,
      "text": "丢掉了将近四百万平方公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00070",
      "start_ms": 168520,
      "end_ms": 170395,
      "text": "您说这是大还是虚？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00071",
      "start_ms": 171000,
      "end_ms": 175875,
      "text": "我前阵子翻到一本叫中华文化常识一千问的书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00072",
      "start_ms": 176710,
      "end_ms": 181180,
      "text": "这本书把中国历史上的文化常识分门别类，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00073",
      "start_ms": 181180,
      "end_ms": 182405,
      "text": "讲的清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00074",
      "start_ms": 182740,
      "end_ms": 184455,
      "text": "从三皇五帝到明清，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00075",
      "start_ms": 184860,
      "end_ms": 186960,
      "text": "从政治经济到科技文化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00076",
      "start_ms": 187200,
      "end_ms": 189495,
      "text": "一千个问题一千个答案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00077",
      "start_ms": 189720,
      "end_ms": 193005,
      "text": "咱们这几集讲的这些朝代丢了多少地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00078",
      "start_ms": 193360,
      "end_ms": 194545,
      "text": "签了什么条约，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00079",
      "start_ms": 194900,
      "end_ms": 196905,
      "text": "为什么丢的书里都有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00080",
      "start_ms": 197300,
      "end_ms": 199625,
      "text": "他不是那种干巴巴的教科书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00081",
      "start_ms": 200040,
      "end_ms": 201915,
      "text": "是一问一答的形式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00082",
      "start_ms": 202310,
      "end_ms": 203090,
      "text": "翻到哪页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00083",
      "start_ms": 203090,
      "end_ms": 203765,
      "text": "看哪页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00084",
      "start_ms": 204220,
      "end_ms": 205955,
      "text": "特别适合中老年朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00085",
      "start_ms": 206480,
      "end_ms": 207755,
      "text": "每天翻两页。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00086",
      "start_ms": 208140,
      "end_ms": 208960,
      "text": "一年下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00087",
      "start_ms": 209180,
      "end_ms": 212635,
      "text": "中国历史的基本脉络心里全有谱了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00088",
      "start_ms": 213010,
      "end_ms": 214165,
      "text": "我已经放下面了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00089",
      "start_ms": 214320,
      "end_ms": 217445,
      "text": "点开就能看到喜欢历史的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00090",
      "start_ms": 217670,
      "end_ms": 219435,
      "text": "弄一本放床头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00091",
      "start_ms": 219850,
      "end_ms": 222335,
      "text": "随手翻一页就是一段历史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00092",
      "start_ms": 223010,
      "end_ms": 223645,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00093",
      "start_ms": 223970,
      "end_ms": 226290,
      "text": "唐朝安史之乱以前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00094",
      "start_ms": 226750,
      "end_ms": 229975,
      "text": "唐朝是一千二百三十七万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00095",
      "start_ms": 230520,
      "end_ms": 231720,
      "text": "安史之乱以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00096",
      "start_ms": 231940,
      "end_ms": 232875,
      "text": "一切都变了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00097",
      "start_ms": 233150,
      "end_ms": 233965,
      "text": "为了评判，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00098",
      "start_ms": 234730,
      "end_ms": 239995,
      "text": "唐肃宗把河西弄右西域的精兵全部东掉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00099",
      "start_ms": 240440,
      "end_ms": 242115,
      "text": "吐蕃趁虚而入，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00100",
      "start_ms": 242480,
      "end_ms": 243785,
      "text": "河西走廊丢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00101",
      "start_ms": 244040,
      "end_ms": 244805,
      "text": "龙又丢了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00102",
      "start_ms": 245420,
      "end_ms": 248110,
      "text": "安溪四镇丢了吐蕃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00103",
      "start_ms": 248110,
      "end_ms": 251180,
      "text": "统治敦煌整整七十年河西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00104",
      "start_ms": 251180,
      "end_ms": 257085,
      "text": "五郡凉州甘州宿州瓜州沙洲一个一个陷落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00105",
      "start_ms": 257940,
      "end_ms": 261265,
      "text": "史书上写此去安息万里江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00106",
      "start_ms": 262090,
      "end_ms": 264045,
      "text": "如今边防在奉翔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00107",
      "start_ms": 264360,
      "end_ms": 264995,
      "text": "什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00108",
      "start_ms": 265370,
      "end_ms": 268365,
      "text": "以前安西都护府在万里之外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00109",
      "start_ms": 268880,
      "end_ms": 270555,
      "text": "现在边防退到了凤翔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00110",
      "start_ms": 271060,
      "end_ms": 272285,
      "text": "离长安没多远了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00111",
      "start_ms": 272700,
      "end_ms": 273980,
      "text": "唐朝中后期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00112",
      "start_ms": 274280,
      "end_ms": 279395,
      "text": "西域、河西走廊、辽东大片领土相继丢失，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00113",
      "start_ms": 280040,
      "end_ms": 282965,
      "text": "总湿地面积超过六百万平方公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00114",
      "start_ms": 283630,
      "end_ms": 285395,
      "text": "一个万国来朝的大唐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00115",
      "start_ms": 285900,
      "end_ms": 289515,
      "text": "最后连自己的都城都被吐蕃攻陷过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00116",
      "start_ms": 290410,
      "end_ms": 293405,
      "text": "您说这是安史之乱还是盛极而衰？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00117",
      "start_ms": 294740,
      "end_ms": 295285,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00118",
      "start_ms": 296410,
      "end_ms": 298285,
      "text": "明朝永乐年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00119",
      "start_ms": 298630,
      "end_ms": 300345,
      "text": "大明版图达到最大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00120",
      "start_ms": 301330,
      "end_ms": 303890,
      "text": "一千一百万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00121",
      "start_ms": 304830,
      "end_ms": 307250,
      "text": "可到了崇祯皇帝自杀的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00122",
      "start_ms": 307570,
      "end_ms": 312930,
      "text": "明朝实际控制的只剩汉地十八省四百多万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00123",
      "start_ms": 313370,
      "end_ms": 316210,
      "text": "丢掉了将近七百万平方公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00124",
      "start_ms": 316510,
      "end_ms": 317350,
      "text": "怎么丢的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00125",
      "start_ms": 318150,
      "end_ms": 320230,
      "text": "朱棣为了打靖难之役，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00126",
      "start_ms": 320610,
      "end_ms": 323470,
      "text": "把大明都司送给了蒙古人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00127",
      "start_ms": 323790,
      "end_ms": 326870,
      "text": "宣宗时期开平行内迁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00128",
      "start_ms": 327850,
      "end_ms": 337140,
      "text": "整个北平行都司放弃丢套到地区东胜位撤销门户大开关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00129",
      "start_ms": 337140,
      "end_ms": 344200,
      "text": "西七位哈密丢了七位百姓迁进嘉峪关土地全被吐鲁番汗国占了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00130",
      "start_ms": 344400,
      "end_ms": 345460,
      "text": "乌斯藏朵干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00131",
      "start_ms": 345880,
      "end_ms": 348840,
      "text": "青藏高原也丢了云南布政司。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00132",
      "start_ms": 348840,
      "end_ms": 350240,
      "text": "下面的三圈六卫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00133",
      "start_ms": 350640,
      "end_ms": 352160,
      "text": "缅甸占了泰国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00134",
      "start_ms": 352160,
      "end_ms": 353420,
      "text": "占了明朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00135",
      "start_ms": 353440,
      "end_ms": 354540,
      "text": "号称不和亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00136",
      "start_ms": 354740,
      "end_ms": 355440,
      "text": "不纳贡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00137",
      "start_ms": 355660,
      "end_ms": 357240,
      "text": "不成臣不割地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00138",
      "start_ms": 357900,
      "end_ms": 360565,
      "text": "可实际上丢的地比谁都多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00139",
      "start_ms": 361160,
      "end_ms": 361725,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00140",
      "start_ms": 362100,
      "end_ms": 363235,
      "text": "西晋等等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00141",
      "start_ms": 364270,
      "end_ms": 365975,
      "text": "西晋不是第六名吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00142",
      "start_ms": 366340,
      "end_ms": 366685,
      "text": "对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00143",
      "start_ms": 367240,
      "end_ms": 371195,
      "text": "第六名是西晋丢掉的北方领土。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00144",
      "start_ms": 371750,
      "end_ms": 375540,
      "text": "我说的第一名是西晋从统一到灭亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00145",
      "start_ms": 375620,
      "end_ms": 377025,
      "text": "丢掉的全部领土。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00146",
      "start_ms": 377680,
      "end_ms": 379555,
      "text": "西晋统一三国的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00147",
      "start_ms": 379930,
      "end_ms": 382605,
      "text": "疆域五百四十多万平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00148",
      "start_ms": 383510,
      "end_ms": 387565,
      "text": "可西晋是历史上最短命的大一统王朝之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00149",
      "start_ms": 388150,
      "end_ms": 389445,
      "text": "从统一到灭亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00150",
      "start_ms": 389750,
      "end_ms": 390765,
      "text": "只用了五十一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00151",
      "start_ms": 391260,
      "end_ms": 392695,
      "text": "八王之乱打了十六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00152",
      "start_ms": 393540,
      "end_ms": 395395,
      "text": "把自己人打的精疲力尽。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00153",
      "start_ms": 396390,
      "end_ms": 397365,
      "text": "北方的匈奴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00154",
      "start_ms": 397880,
      "end_ms": 400540,
      "text": "鲜卑节将五个少数民族，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00155",
      "start_ms": 400540,
      "end_ms": 402955,
      "text": "趁乱南下永嘉之乱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00156",
      "start_ms": 403440,
      "end_ms": 404295,
      "text": "洛阳丢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00157",
      "start_ms": 404640,
      "end_ms": 405580,
      "text": "长安丢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00158",
      "start_ms": 405700,
      "end_ms": 406675,
      "text": "西晋灭亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00159",
      "start_ms": 407030,
      "end_ms": 408395,
      "text": "北方全部沦陷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00160",
      "start_ms": 408940,
      "end_ms": 410415,
      "text": "东晋退到江南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00161",
      "start_ms": 410640,
      "end_ms": 412415,
      "text": "只剩三百来万平方公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00162",
      "start_ms": 412960,
      "end_ms": 416355,
      "text": "西晋丢掉了北方将近两百五十万平方公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00163",
      "start_ms": 417020,
      "end_ms": 419595,
      "text": "可惜晋丢掉的不只是土地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00164",
      "start_ms": 419990,
      "end_ms": 422025,
      "text": "是整个北方是中原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00165",
      "start_ms": 422650,
      "end_ms": 423375,
      "text": "是长安，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00166",
      "start_ms": 423640,
      "end_ms": 424295,
      "text": "是洛阳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00167",
      "start_ms": 424660,
      "end_ms": 425360,
      "text": "是汉人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00168",
      "start_ms": 425400,
      "end_ms": 427305,
      "text": "几百年来经营的家底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00169",
      "start_ms": 427920,
      "end_ms": 428780,
      "text": "从此以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00170",
      "start_ms": 428980,
      "end_ms": 431715,
      "text": "中国南北分裂了将近三百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00171",
      "start_ms": 432250,
      "end_ms": 433795,
      "text": "别的朝代丢了地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00172",
      "start_ms": 434850,
      "end_ms": 436350,
      "text": "后来还收回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00173",
      "start_ms": 436350,
      "end_ms": 438225,
      "text": "一些西晋丢了地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00174",
      "start_ms": 439070,
      "end_ms": 441245,
      "text": "直接导致了五胡乱华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00175",
      "start_ms": 441650,
      "end_ms": 442715,
      "text": "导致了南北朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00176",
      "start_ms": 443450,
      "end_ms": 447635,
      "text": "导致了中国历史上最长的一段分裂时期。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00177",
      "start_ms": 447900,
      "end_ms": 450145,
      "text": "您说这个第一名服不服？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00178",
      "start_ms": 450490,
      "end_ms": 451525,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00179",
      "start_ms": 452030,
      "end_ms": 458685,
      "text": "这十个朝代没有一个是因为弱才排上来的秦朝毁在统一太短，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00180",
      "start_ms": 459210,
      "end_ms": 461305,
      "text": "隋朝败在操之过急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00181",
      "start_ms": 461820,
      "end_ms": 464445,
      "text": "宋朝栽在重文轻武，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00182",
      "start_ms": 464750,
      "end_ms": 466715,
      "text": "汉朝坏在后期失控，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00183",
      "start_ms": 467240,
      "end_ms": 469515,
      "text": "戚晋死在自家人打自家人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00184",
      "start_ms": 469980,
      "end_ms": 472945,
      "text": "清朝亏在签了三百多个不平等条约。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00185",
      "start_ms": 473500,
      "end_ms": 475845,
      "text": "元朝乱在皇位争夺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00186",
      "start_ms": 476290,
      "end_ms": 478145,
      "text": "唐朝垮在安史之乱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00187",
      "start_ms": 478590,
      "end_ms": 480745,
      "text": "明朝错在主动放弃。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00188",
      "start_ms": 481390,
      "end_ms": 481830,
      "text": "西晋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00189",
      "start_ms": 481830,
      "end_ms": 484890,
      "text": "痛在直接导致三百年分裂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00190",
      "start_ms": 485370,
      "end_ms": 489650,
      "text": "每一个朝代丢掉的领土都不只是一串数字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00191",
      "start_ms": 490030,
      "end_ms": 491090,
      "text": "是一段教训，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00192",
      "start_ms": 491930,
      "end_ms": 492750,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cf0219a18522dec5_s00193",
      "start_ms": 492950,
      "end_ms": 494545,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
